# OS / editor cruft
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*~
*.tmp
*.bak
*.orig

# Two-pass VP9 leaves these behind if an encode is interrupted
*.pass-0.log
*.pass-0.log.mbtree

# The mp4 video MASTERS that tools/convert-media.py encodes into assets/*.webm.
# ~54MB of source that nothing on the site ever requests — the shipped media is
# the webm. Keep them here to re-encode from, but never commit or deploy them,
# and never leave them in assets/: gen-asset-manifest.mjs walks that whole folder,
# so an mp4 sitting there gets added to the preloader's warm list and the reader
# waits on 54MB they will never watch.
video-sources/

# See .vercelignore for what is excluded from the DEPLOY (notably "LBD 1/", the
# game's authoring copy with its God Mode / QA suites — game/ is what ships).
